  <Docs>
    <summary>Provides data for a change to full-screen magnification.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>This .NET event-data class stores the arguments from the legacy magnification listener callback. Its properties return the values supplied to its constructor; the region is not copied.</para>
      <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/accessibilityservice/AccessibilityService.MagnificationController.OnMagnificationChangedListener#onMagnificationChanged(android.accessibilityservice.AccessibilityService.MagnificationController,%20android.graphics.Region,%20float,%20float,%20float)">Android magnification callback reference</a> and <a href="https://github.com/dotnet/java-interop/blob/92b5d471f1e0f6164fc332b1f661b472f5cf3aad/tools/generator/SourceWriters/InterfaceEventArgsClass.cs">.NET event-data generation</a>.</format></para>
